\newlabel{tab:la_main}{{4}{14}{All calibration metrics for \texttt {laplace-torch} variants on Two Moons. All variants achieve Acc$=0.92$ and MActErr$=0.08$. GS = grid search; ML = marginal likelihood; LL = last-layer. Bold = best per column}{table.caption.33}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Uncertainty patterns under marginal likelihood tuning. (a)~All marglik variants show a narrow stripe; outside it the model is maximally confident. (b)~Surprisingly, Kron/all marglik does detect OOD in the corners (mutual information up to $0.45$): the all-weights posterior retains some OOD sensitivity despite marglik's tendency towards diffuse priors.}}{15}{figure.caption.37}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:la_stripe}{{6}{15}{Uncertainty patterns under marginal likelihood tuning. (a)~All marglik variants show a narrow stripe; outside it the model is maximally confident. (b)~Surprisingly, Kron/all marglik does detect OOD in the corners (mutual information up to $0.45$): the all-weights posterior retains some OOD sensitivity despite marglik's tendency towards diffuse priors}{figure.caption.37}{}}
